**DengueSphere** is an interactive platform for spatial analysis and clustering of dengue cases, based on the **DBSCAN (Density-Based Spatial Clustering)** algorithm.

With the system, you can:

- Load geographic datasets (latitude, longitude and date);
- Define clustering parameters;
- Visualize clusters on interactive maps;
- Generate statistics on the distribution of clusters.

> **Tip:** If your dataset **does not contain geographic coordinates**, use the **"Coordinates"** module to **automatically generate coordinates**, **download the updated dataset**, and then **load it into the "Clustering Tool" module**.
> Depending on the dataset size and request rate, this process may **take a few minutes**.

Use the side menu to navigate between sections.
